  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sococo Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Enterprise Sococo B.V. is a sustainable Coffee label based in the Netherlands that sells 100% arabica quality coffee from Guatemala (HueHuetanango region) in the Netherlands. The Netherlands is in the top 5 of coffee drinking countries and the market is shifting from low quality coffee to higher quality (specialty) coffee. Sococo buys the coffee directly from their coffee farming partner, FamilyBondsCoffee. Sococo pays them a price that is above the current international market price. Sococo focuses on positive impact, capacity building and sustainability in the full supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
